---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = 'KTM 2019 TPI Tips - Arizona Dirt Bike Rentals';
const description = "Really like the solid TPI throttle response, crisp and clean every time, except when you start the machine on cold mornings. I've found one reliable fix for the cold-start issue.";
const date = 'September 15, 2018';
---
<Layout title={title} description={description}>

  <div class="post-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="post-meta">
        <a href="/blog/" class="back-link">← Blog</a>
        <span class="post-date">{date}</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="display">KTM 2019<br>TPI Tips.</h1>
    </div>
  </div>

  <article class="post-body">
    <div class="wrap post-content">
      <p>Really like the solid TPI throttle response — crisp and clean every time, except when you start the machine on cold mornings. Other posts I've read share a similar cold-start issue. I'm far from an expert on this new machine, but I have found one reliable solution.</p>

      <h2>The Cold-Start Problem</h2>
      <p>The vacuum system on the two-stroke TPI engine is particularly sensitive. Even minor dirt accumulation on the air filter can prevent the engine from starting or cause spark plug fouling. This seems to be the root cause of most of the cold-morning start issues reported across the community.</p>

      <h2>The Fix</h2>
      <p>Keep the air filter clean. It sounds simple, but the TPI system is more sensitive to filter condition than a carbureted two-stroke. A slightly dirty filter that would run fine on a carb bike can kill a cold start on the TPI. Clean it more frequently than you think you need to.</p>

      <p>Once the filter is clean, the cold-start issue disappears. The throttle response returns to that crisp, clean feel that makes the TPI genuinely excellent in every other condition.</p>
    </div>
  </article>

  <section class="call-cta">
    <div class="section-label">Ride One Yourself</div>
    <p class="reserve-label">Reserve Your Day</p>
    <a href="tel:5092810156" class="final-phone display">509 · 281 · 0156</a>
    <p class="final-note">Seven days a week · All year · Se habla español</p>
  </section>

</Layout>

<style>
  .post-hero { background: var(--cream-deep); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 80px 0; }
  .post-meta { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 20px; margin-bottom: 24px; }
  .back-link { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--rust); text-decoration: none; }
  .back-link:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  .post-date { font-size: 13px; color: var(--leather-soft); font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .post-hero h1 { font-size: clamp(40px, 6.5vw, 84px); color: var(--leather); }

  .post-body { padding: 80px 0 100px; background: var(--cream); }
  .post-content { max-width: 740px; }
  .post-content p { font-size: 18px; color: var(--leather-soft); line-height: 1.75; margin-bottom: 24px; }
  .post-content h2 { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--leather); margin: 48px 0 16px; padding-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 3px solid var(--rust); }
  .post-content strong { color: var(--leather); font-weight: 700; }

  .call-cta { background: var(--ink); color: var(--cream); text-align: center; padding: 80px 24px; border-top: 3px solid var(--rust); }
  .reserve-label { font-size: clamp(20px, 2vw, 28px); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--rust); margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .final-phone { font-size: clamp(48px, 7vw, 96px); color: var(--rust); text-decoration: none; display: block; margin: 16px 0; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
  .final-phone:hover { color: var(--cream); }
  .final-note { font-size: 19px; letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #ffffff; font-weight: 600; }
</style>
